        Located north of Idaho Falls near the scenic banks of the Snake River, Grant is a peaceful rural community of expansive farm acreage, custom country homes, and multi-generation family properties. Homes here operate on independent domestic wells and propane fuel systems, requiring rugged, high-capacity water heaters that can handle heavy mineral content and freezing winter temperatures. Idaho Falls Water Heater Pros offers dedicated propane water heater repair, sediment power flushing, and replacement services throughout Grant.
