                <td>Very High (90+ gal first hour)</td>
                <td>Limitless continuous flow</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Operating Cost</strong></td>
                <td>Higher electrical demand</td>
                <td>Cost-effective LP usage</td>
                <td>High efficiency (burns fuel on demand)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Hard Water Defense</strong></td>
                <td>Vulnerable lower element</td>
                <td>Requires periodic flushes</td>
                <td>Annual citric acid descale required</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
