        <span class="section-tag">Local Service Corridors</span>
        <h2>Streets & Roads We Regularly Service in Grant</h2>
        <p>
          Our service vehicles provide comprehensive coverage throughout all residential streets, subdivisions, and rural routes in Grant, including:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>North 3500 East:</strong> Complete diagnostics, rapid leak repair, annual maintenance, and emergency replacements.</li>
          <li><strong>Grant Highway:</strong> Complete diagnostics, rapid leak repair, annual maintenance, and emergency replacements.</li>
